OL,3,GNEWSA'No excuse for venues not to use
OL,4,AAsk for Angela'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe creator of the Ask for Angela
OL,7,Fcampaign says its new charity status
OL,8,Fwill help it support more people who
OL,9,Ffeel unsafe on a night out.
OL,11,FHayley Crawford started the scheme 10
OL,12,Fyears ago in Lincoln pubs and named it
OL,13,Fafter Angela Phillips, a family friend
OL,14,Fwho was killed by her husband in 2012.
OL,16,FAsk for Angela allows people who feel
OL,17,Funsafe in bars or clubs to discreetly
OL,18,Fseek help. When someone "asks for
OL,19,FAngela", staff can help them leave
OL,20,Fsafely or take them to a secure area.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
